<title>UK: Wet Brent trades lower at Dec -48 cents - traders.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades lower at Dec -48 cents - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo with 11-13 Nov loading dates traded at Dec Brent -48 cents on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>On Monday, physical Brent traded at Dec Brent -35 cents for a Nov 15-17 loader and at Dec Brent -42 cents for a Nov 13-15 loader.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
